# Team photo pixels, generated from /picture by lab08/tools/make_team_photo.py.
# The script and the team_photo.h dimensions header are committed; the bitmap
# itself is not, so the photo is never pushed.  Rerun the script after cloning:
#   python3 lab08/tools/make_team_photo.py
/lab08/*/Core/Src/team_photo.c